Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/hca: align the window used by the float DSP
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later (same as the modified FFmpeg source)
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

The SIMD vector_fmul_window implementation requires aligned input. The plain
float array is only 8-byte aligned in the llvm-mingw i686 build and faults on
movaps. Match the 32-byte alignment already used by HCA's channel arrays.
No coefficients or arithmetic change.

--- a/libavcodec/hca_data.h
+++ b/libavcodec/hca_data.h
@@ -65 +65 @@
-static const float window[128] =
+DECLARE_ALIGNED(32, static const float, window)[128] =
